/-!
The former contents attempted to derive joint local finiteness from singleton coordinate
subdifferentials.  That implication is false for extended-real saddle kernels: a separately
convex-concave checkerboard can be finite on both coordinate axes and infinite off-axis.
The downstream differentiability theorem now takes local finiteness as an explicit qualification.
-/

